msgid "Order Identifier Prefix"
msgstr ""

#: classes/cmi.class.php:263
msgid "Example: order 1050 appears as %s, both in WooCommerce and in the CMI back office. The prefix keeps this shop's order numbers different from any other website using the same CMI account. It was generated automatically; you can replace it with something more readable, such as your shop's initials. Orders already sent to CMI keep their number."
